Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:16:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] fix: complete OpenVR 2.x interface support (build errors)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

修复上一轮 CI 暴露的 6 处编译错误：

1. libparse.py 支持 'enum class X : uint32_t' 语法
   —— 根因：旧正则不匹配 enum class，导致 EVRDistortionChannel
      未被登记进类型上下文，生成的 CVRSystem_026 类（全局作用域）
      缺少 vr:: 前缀而报 C2061 / C3668 / C2259
2. BaseCompositor.h 增加 OOVR_EVRCompositorTextureUsage 类型别名
3. BaseApplications 增加 RegisterSubprocess 空实现
4. BaseInput 眼动追踪方法从 private 移到 public
5. BaseChaperoneSetup::SetWorkingPerimeter 参数补 const（对齐新版头文件）
---
 OpenOVR/Reimpl/BaseApplications.cpp   |  6 ++++++
 OpenOVR/Reimpl/BaseApplications.h     |  1 +
 OpenOVR/Reimpl/BaseChaperoneSetup.cpp |  2 +-
 OpenOVR/Reimpl/BaseChaperoneSetup.h   |  2 +-
 OpenOVR/Reimpl/BaseCompositor.cpp     |  2 +-
 OpenOVR/Reimpl/BaseCompositor.h       |  3 ++-
 OpenOVR/Reimpl/BaseInput.h            | 10 ++++++----
 scripts/libparse.py                   |  2 +-
 8 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

